            <h1 id="separation-title">Before separation or divorce moves, understand what your shared digital life still reveals.</h1>
            <p>You built a life together. Your digital lives joined too.</p>
            <p>Devices were shared. Accounts became connected. Recovery methods, cloud storage, permissions and everyday access accumulated quietly over years. The relationship can change in a day. That digital overlap rarely disappears with it.</p>
            <p>Before confrontation, negotiation or broad account changes, Toza shows you what remains, fixes what is urgent and hardens what matters. Private, in person and with you present.</p>
